WEBVTT

00:01:57.530 --> 00:02:00.366
by turning kindness into a scalable,

00:02:00.366 --> 00:02:03.744
collectively-owned asset called goodwill.

00:02:05.079 --> 00:02:07.957
You know, and then for us,
for many of us, my life,

00:02:07.999 --> 00:02:10.001
the years just pass at a dizzying pace

00:02:10.042 --> 00:02:12.670
and I collected a couple of fancy degrees,

00:02:12.712 --> 00:02:15.214
I became a dad myself three times over.

00:02:15.673 --> 00:02:19.177
And I found myself wheeling and dealing
as an investment banker

00:02:19.177 --> 00:02:22.096
and a private equity investor
for many years.

00:02:22.638 --> 00:02:25.099
And the lessons from that red helicopter,

00:02:25.141 --> 00:02:28.728
they seemed incredibly childish
and weirdly misguided

00:02:28.728 --> 00:02:30.521
in the world of business and finance.